        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Once Upon a Time in Vietnam, The Caine Mutiny Court-Martial, Showtime, Failure to Launch\n- People: Dustin Nguyen, William Friedkin, Ian McKellen\n- Roles: actor, director\n\nFacts:\n- Dustin Nguyen starred in the 2013 film Once Upon a Time in Vietnam.\n- Dustin Nguyen appeared in The Caine Mutiny Court-Martial.\n- The Caine Mutiny Court-Martial was the directorial debut of American film director William Friedkin.\n- William Friedkin's other credits include directing the films Showtime and Failure to Launch.\n- William Friedkin's other credits also include work related to Ian McKellen.",
